rt and Walmart Neighborhood Market brands; membership-only warehouse clubs; and ecommerce websites, such as walmart.com.mx, walmart.ca, flipkart.com, PhonePe and other sites. It offers grocery items, including dry grocery, snacks, dairy, meat, produce, deli and bakery, frozen foods, alcoholic and nonalcoholic beverages, as well as consumables, such as health and beauty aids, pet supplies, household chemicals, paper goods, and baby products; and fuel and other categories. In addition, it is involved in the provision of health and wellness products covering pharmacy, optical and hearing services, over-the-counter drugs, and protein and nutrition products; and home, hardlines, and seasonal items, including home improvement, outdoor living, gardening, furniture, apparel, jewelry, tools and power equipment, housewares, toys, and mattresses. Furt", "customer_type": {"primary": "B2C", "label": "Walmart vend principalement aux consommateurs finaux via ses magasins et son commerce électronique.", "_source": "Cerebras Qwen-3 10-K"}, "revenue_by_segment": {"label": "Répartition du chiffre d'affaires par segment (exercice 2026)", "slices": [{"name": "Walmart U S", "label": "Walmart U S", "label_en": "Walmart U S", "value": 482.975, "share_pct": 68.4, "pct": 68.4, "unit": "Mds $"}, {"name": "Walmart International", "label": "Walmart International", "label_en": "Walmart International", "value": 130.423, "share_pct": 18.5, "pct": 18.5, "unit": "Mds $"}, {"name": "Sams Club", "label": "Sams Club", "label_en": "Sams Club", "value": 93.015, "share_pct": 13.2, "pct": 13.2, "unit": "Mds $"}], "fiscal_year": "exercice 2026", "currency": "USD", "_source": "FMP revenue-product-segmentation FY2026 (2026-01-31) - SEC 10-K", "_fmp_extracted_at": "2026-07-13T09:00:00Z", "unit": "Mds $"}, "_blocs_extracted_at": "2026-05-14T21:08:36.044240+00:00", "revenue_by_geography": {"label": "Répartition géographique du chiffre d'affaires (exercice 2026)", "slices": [{"name": "États-Unis", "label": "États